# Public API (tp:*)
  -- Take lifecycle (take ops on tm, view-state on tv)
  @api tp:currentTake()  @ 69
  @api tp:bind(t)  @ 72-78
      @contract  with a take, bind it on tm and seed tv; no arg = activation, resolve the selection  @ 71
  @api tp:unbind()  @ 80-84
      @contract  leaving hands the caret back to arrange as a QN; no instance, no move  @ 79
  @api tp:dropTake()  @ 87
      @contract  if take is destroyed, detach tm and blank the grid. Distinct from unbind.  @ 86
  @api tp:reloadFromReaper()  @ 90
      @contract  for coord's external-mutation watcher; re-reads the bound take, no swap  @ 89
  -- Selection — the tracker owns (track, slot) in cm; tv holds the nav + resolve,
  @api tp:bindFromSelection()  @ 96-112
      @contract  rebind to the selection take on change. See docs/trackerPage.md § Selection  @ 95
  -- Page interface — render delegates to the renderer; the watcher brackets the frame
